                {
                    "text": "Whichever option of yourself you present; whichever country you travel to, you remain the refined man. This sea-colored outfit, your ocean-colored eyes are a perfect match for your song. I believe the title \"Cold Resonance\" turns into a...\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude07 \"GOLD Resonance\"! Anyway... simply put... it is--- a song for your new Diamont album. Isn't it?\ud83d\ude0aThank you!",
